---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro'
---

<MainLayout title="About">
  <img src="/img/cards/od.png" class="myFaceImg" alt="Juan Manuel" />

  <h3 id="jqs" class="jt1">Who I am</h3>
  <div id="cjqs">
    <p class="marginLR">Hi, my name is Juan Manuel Díaz Gómez, better known as Juanma. I'm a passionate person who loves what I do and am eager to keep doing it. I come from a small town called Las Mesas in Nariño, but currently live in Manizales, Caldas for my studies. Programming is a very fascinating and interesting tool that solves any kind of computational problem, and it has become a way of life for me. I love the feeling of finishing a project that meets or even exceeds my expectations.</p>
    <br />
    <p class="marginLR">I'm aware of how little I know, and although I've tried to learn about many things so I'm not too dependent when I need them, I've always devoted significant time to everything that encompasses programming. Since I was 17 I haven't stopped learning and practicing, and I'm sure I'll continue for much longer. I love learning new things and I appreciate the effort people make to share their knowledge.</p>
    <br />
    <p class="marginLR">I identify as a sincere, serious and methodical person when it comes to work. I love working in teams and achieving great things with other people.</p>
  </div>

  <h3 id="jlqph" class="jt1">What I can do</h3>
  <div id="cjlqph">
    <h4 id="jlqph_p" class="jt2">Programming</h4>
    <div id="cjlqph_p">
      <p class="marginLR">My main skill is programming. I've been coding for over 4 years non-stop, always trying to improve. The following table shows a percentage associated with my skill level in each language, tool or library (100% = full mastery, based on my own judgement).</p>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
        <table>
          <tr>
            <td class="tdTitle">⫷⫸</td>
            <td class="tdTitle">Language</td>
            <td class="tdTitle">Level</td>
            <td class="tdTitle">Experience</td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/languages/java.svg" alt="Java"/></td><td>Java</td><td>70%</td><td>4 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/languages/python.svg" alt="Python"/></td><td>Python</td><td>85%</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/languages/javascript.svg" alt="JavaScript"/></td><td>JavaScript</td><td>65%</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/languages/kotlin.svg" alt="Kotlin"/></td><td>Kotlin</td><td>80%</td><td>3 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/firebase.svg" alt="Firebase"/></td><td>Firebase</td><td>80%</td><td>3 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/mysql.svg" alt="MySQL"/></td><td>mySQL</td><td>60%</td><td>4 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/html.svg" alt="HTML"/></td><td>HTML</td><td>95%</td><td>4 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/css.svg" alt="CSS"/></td><td>CSS</td><td>85%</td><td>4 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td style="background-color:#000"><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/LaTex.svg" alt="LaTeX"/></td><td>LaTeX</td><td>60%</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/nodejs.svg" alt="Node.js"/></td><td>Node.js</td><td>20%</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/git.svg" alt="Git"/></td><td>Git</td><td>20%</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/gsap.svg" alt="GSAP"/></td><td>GSAP</td><td>60%</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h4 id="jlqph_d" class="jt2">Design</h4>
    <div id="cjlqph_d">
      <p class="marginLR">My design knowledge comes from basic courses on Adobe tools, Blender, OBS, FL Studio, etc. My experience is limited but enough to handle small designs.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
        <table>
          <tr>
            <td class="tdTitle">⩷</td>
            <td class="tdTitle">Tool</td>
            <td class="tdTitle">Level</td>
            <td class="tdTitle">Experience</td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/illustrator.svg" alt="Illustrator"/></td><td>Illustrator</td><td>80%</td><td>4 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/photoshop.svg" alt="Photoshop"/></td><td>Photoshop</td><td>75%</td><td>4 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/premiere.svg" alt="Premiere"/></td><td>Premiere</td><td>65%</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/xd.svg" alt="XD"/></td><td>Xd</td><td>90%</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/animate.svg" alt="Animate"/></td><td>Animate</td><td>30%</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/indesign.svg" alt="InDesign"/></td><td>InDesign</td><td>75%</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/blender.svg" alt="Blender"/></td><td>Blender</td><td>30%</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/obs.svg" alt="OBS"/></td><td>OBS</td><td>80%</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/flStudio.svg" alt="FL Studio"/></td><td>FL Studio</td><td>10%</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h4 id="jlqph_o" class="jt2">Office Suite</h4>
    <div id="cjlqph_o">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
        <table>
          <tr>
            <td class="tdTitle">Program</td>
            <td class="tdTitle">Level</td>
            <td class="tdTitle">Experience</td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/visualBasic.svg" alt="Visual Basic"/></td><td>Visual Basic</td><td>10%</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/excel.svg" alt="Excel"/></td><td>Excel</td><td>75%</td><td>6 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/powerPoint.svg" alt="PowerPoint"/></td><td>Power Point</td><td>80%</td><td>6 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/word.svg" alt="Word"/></td><td>Word</td><td>90%</td><td>8 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/publisher.svg" alt="Publisher"/></td><td>Publisher</td><td>60%</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td><img class="icoLenguajes" src="/img/access.svg" alt="Access"/></td><td>Access</td><td>15%</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 id="jlqhh" class="jt1">What I've built</h3>
  <div id="cjlqhh">
    <div class="contToPage">
      <h4 class="jt2">Icfes para disciplinados</h4>
      <a class="aToPage" href="https://icfesparadisciplinados.github.io/pages/login.html" target="_blank">
        <img class="icoToPage" src="/img/icfes.svg" alt="Icfes" />
        <p class="pToPage">Go to site</p>
        <img class="xToPage" src="/img/x.svg" alt="link" />
      </a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="marginLR">A platform to share study material for the Colombian Saber 11 exam. Access with document: <strong>0123456789</strong> / password: <strong>ABCD</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="contToPage">
      <h4 class="jt2">Catálogo boutique Arcur</h4>
      <a class="aToPage" href="https://boutiquearcurcolombia.web.app/" target="_blank">
        <img class="icoToPage" src="/img/arcur.svg" alt="Arcur" />
        <p class="pToPage">Go to site</p>
        <img class="xToPage" src="/img/x.svg" alt="link" />
      </a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="marginLR">Product catalog for Colombian clothing brand Arcur, with a hidden admin CRUD system.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="spaceBottom"></div>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  @import '../styles/sections/about.css';
</style>

<script>
  import { ajustarTituloContenido } from '../lib/core/utils.js'

  ajustarTituloContenido('jqs')
  ajustarTituloContenido('jlqph')
  ajustarTituloContenido('jlqph_p')
  ajustarTituloContenido('jlqph_d')
  ajustarTituloContenido('jlqph_o')
  ajustarTituloContenido('jlqhh')
</script>